module.exports = [{"condition_id":"NPS_UAMB","text":"The mechanic observed that the truck needed several more hours to be repaired.","question":"Had the truck broken down?","options":"Yes|No","list":"p","item_id":8,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPS","correct":"Yes"},{"condition_id":"MVRR_AMB","text":"The professor awarded the grant gained more attention from marine biologists.","question":"Did the professor award the grant to someone?","options":"Yes|No","list":"p","item_id":6,"block":2,"RNDM":"MVRR","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"AttachHigh","text":"Karl recognized the hostage of the pirates who was on TV this morning on the local news.","question":"Who was on TV this morning?","options":"The hostage|The pirates","list":"p","item_id":58,"block":2,"RNDM":"Attach","correct":"The hostage"},{"condition_id":"MVRR_UAMB","text":"The basketball player who was handed the contract created another controversy in the NBA.","question":"Did the player hand the contract to someone?","options":"Yes|No","list":"p","item_id":14,"block":2,"RNDM":"MVRR","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"AttachMulti","text":"Everyone at the party groaned at the bodyguards of the divas who smoke clove cigarettes constantly.","question":"What type of cigarettes are smoked?","options":"Menthol|Clove","list":"p","item_id":66,"block":2,"RNDM":"Attach","correct":"Clove"},{"condition_id":"NPZ_AMB","text":"Although the player lost the bonus remained essentially the same as in the original contract.","question":"Did the player lose the bonus?","options":"Yes|No","list":"p","item_id":10,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPZ","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"RC_Obj","text":"The manager who the boss visited remembered some inconvenient facts.","question":"Who remembered the facts?","options":"The boss|The manager","list":"p","item_id":37,"block":2,"RNDM":"RC","correct":"The manager"},{"condition_id":"NPZ_UAMB","text":"When the little girl attacked, the lamb remained relatively calm despite the sudden assault.","question":"Was the little girl kind to the lamb?","options":"Yes|No","list":"p","item_id":16,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPZ","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"NPS_AMB","text":"The assistant manager discovered the training seemed unnecessarily demanding for new staff.","question":"Was the training difficult?","options":"Yes|No","list":"p","item_id":12,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPS","correct":"Yes"},{"condition_id":"AttachLow","text":"During the play, we all heckled the murderers of the prince who was disguised as a peasant from nearby Trosselheim.","question":"Who dressed as a peasant?","options":"The murderers|The prince","list":"p","item_id":59,"block":2,"RNDM":"Attach","correct":"The prince"},{"condition_id":"RC_Subj","text":"The monkeys that watched the zookeepers charged the bars of their cage.","question":"Who charged the bars of the cage?","options":"The zookeepers|The monkeys","list":"p","item_id":39,"block":2,"RNDM":"RC","correct":"The monkeys"},{"condition_id":"MVRR_AMB","text":"The engineer brought the equipment required constant supervision from senior technicians.","question":"Did the engineer bring the equipment to someone?","options":"Yes|No","list":"p","item_id":15,"block":2,"RNDM":"MVRR","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"AttachMulti","text":"At the charity show, Noreen nodded to the sidekick of the actor who was juggling sharp knives and glass bottles.","question":"Who juggled sharp knives?","options":"The sidekick|The actor","list":"p","item_id":60,"block":2,"RNDM":"Attach","correct":"BOTH"},{"condition_id":"NPZ_AMB","text":"Once the recent hire started the job prepared many students for careers in media.","question":"Did the job help any students?","options":"Yes|No","list":"p","item_id":11,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPZ","correct":"Yes"},{"condition_id":"NPS_UAMB","text":"The corrupt politician mentioned that the bill received unwelcome attention from southern voters.","question":"Did the bill receive any negative attention?","options":"Yes|No","list":"p","item_id":2,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPS","correct":"Yes"},{"condition_id":"AttachHigh","text":"At her orientation, Tamara recently met the nephews of the professor who paint beautiful portraits of local celebrities.","question":"Who paints portraits?","options":"The nephews|The professor","list":"p","item_id":70,"block":2,"RNDM":"Attach","correct":"The nephews"},{"condition_id":"MVRR_UAMB","text":"The yoga instructor who was offered the position demanded immense physical effort from everyone.","question":"Did the instructor offer the position to someone?","options":"Yes|No","list":"p","item_id":17,"block":2,"RNDM":"MVRR","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"NPS_AMB","text":"The guitarist knew the song failed dramatically because of the tensions within the band.","question":"Did the band members have some interpersonal conflict?","options":"Yes|No","list":"p","item_id":9,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPS","correct":"Yes"},{"condition_id":"AttachLow","text":"Everyone at the coffee shop sympathized with the courier of the florists who were complaining about the weather.","question":"Who complained about the weather?","options":"The courier|The florists","list":"p","item_id":71,"block":2,"RNDM":"Attach","correct":"The florists"},{"condition_id":"NPZ_UAMB","text":"Because the suspect changed, the file deserved further investigation during the jury discussions.","question":"Did the suspect change the file?","options":"Yes|No","list":"p","item_id":1,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPZ","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"RC_Subj","text":"The class that disliked the teacher skimmed the reading for the week.","question":"Who was disliked?","options":"The class|The teacher","list":"p","item_id":28,"block":2,"RNDM":"RC","correct":"The teacher"},{"condition_id":"RC_Obj","text":"The bus driver who the kids followed wondered about the location of a hotel.","question":"Who was being followed?","options":"The bus driver|The kids","list":"p","item_id":25,"block":2,"RNDM":"RC","correct":"The bus driver"},{"condition_id":"MVRR_UAMB","text":"The mayor who was sent the document provided sufficient evidence that it was simply blackmail.","question":"Did the mayor send the document to someone?","options":"Yes|No","list":"p","item_id":13,"block":2,"RNDM":"MVRR","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"AttachMulti","text":"Despite the good press, we didn't really like the commanders of the soldiers who whistle very loudly and for no reason at all.","question":"Who whistles loudly?","options":"The commanders|The soldiers","list":"p","item_id":72,"block":2,"RNDM":"Attach","correct":"BOTH"},{"condition_id":"NPZ_UAMB","text":"Once the operator stopped, the machine started working efficiently without any supervision.","question":"Did the operator stop the machine?","options":"Yes|No","list":"p","item_id":20,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPZ","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"NPS_AMB","text":"The woman maintained the mail disappeared mysteriously from her front porch.","question":"Could the woman find the mail?","options":"Yes|No","list":"p","item_id":3,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPS","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"NPZ_AMB","text":"After the technician called the service stopped working almost immediately to his surprise.","question":"Did the technician stop working?","options":"Yes|No","list":"p","item_id":7,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPZ","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"AttachHigh","text":"From the lounge everyone could see the pilots of the millionaire who were distrusted by everyone at the company.","question":"Who could everyone see?","options":"Pilots|Millionaires","list":"p","item_id":64,"block":2,"RNDM":"Attach","correct":"Pilots"},{"condition_id":"RC_Subj","text":"The movie star who visited the organizers proposed an annual prize.","question":"Who proposed a prize?","options":"The movie star|The organizers","list":"p","item_id":40,"block":2,"RNDM":"RC","correct":"The movie star"},{"condition_id":"NPS_UAMB","text":"The new doctor demonstrated that the operation appeared increasingly likely to succeed.","question":"What did the doctor demonstrate?","options":"The operation|The operation's likelihood of success","list":"p","item_id":5,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPS","correct":"The operation's likelihood of success"},{"condition_id":"RC_Obj","text":"The mathematician who the chairman visited created a solution to the wellknown problem.","question":"Who created the solution?","options":"The mathematician|The chairman","list":"p","item_id":38,"block":2,"RNDM":"RC","correct":"The mathematician"},{"condition_id":"MVRR_AMB","text":"The boy fed the chicken stayed surprisingly happy despite having a mild allergic reaction.","question":"Did the boy feed the chicken?","options":"Yes|No","list":"p","item_id":4,"block":2,"RNDM":"MVRR","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"AttachLow","text":"On the news they showed the accomplice of the thieves who were indicted for stealing the Mona Lisa.","question":"Where did they show the accomplices?","options":"A documentary|The news","list":"p","item_id":65,"block":2,"RNDM":"Attach","correct":"The news"},{"condition_id":"NPZ_AMB","text":"While the governor read the contract received sweeping support from the audience at the rally.","question":"How much support did the contract receive?","options":"Limited|Extensive","list":"p","item_id":18,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPZ","correct":"Extensive"},{"condition_id":"AttachMulti","text":"During the budget negotiation, Janet charmed the assistant of the executive who decides almost everything in secret.","question":"What was the venue?","options":"A casual party|A business meeting","list":"p","item_id":54,"block":2,"RNDM":"Attach","correct":"A business meeting"},{"condition_id":"RC_Subj","text":"The children who woke the father bothered him about the trip to the beach.","question":"Who was woken up?","options":"The children|The father","list":"p","item_id":27,"block":2,"RNDM":"RC","correct":"The father"},{"condition_id":"MVRR_UAMB","text":"The patient who was refused the treatment continued causing uncomfortable scenes in the ER.","question":"Did the patient refuse the treatment?","options":"Yes|No","list":"p","item_id":19,"block":2,"RNDM":"MVRR","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"MVRR_AMB","text":"The apprentice baker assigned the oven produced smaller cakes because he lacked experience.","question":"Did the apprentice baker assign the oven to someone?","options":"Yes|No","list":"p","item_id":24,"block":2,"RNDM":"MVRR","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"RC_Obj","text":"The chef who the cameraman distracted poured the flour onto the counter.","question":"Who was being distracted?","options":"The chef|The cameraman","list":"p","item_id":26,"block":2,"RNDM":"RC","correct":"The chef"},{"condition_id":"AttachLow","text":"At the potluck, Marcus chatted with the aunts of the nun who bakes sugar cookies with cute designs.","question":"What kind of cookies were they?","options":"Oatmeal cookies|Sugar cookies","list":"p","item_id":53,"block":2,"RNDM":"Attach","correct":"Sugar cookies"},{"condition_id":"NPS_UAMB","text":"The new chef claimed that the restaurant separated mediocre cooks from gifted ones.","question":"Did the chef join the restaurant recently?","options":"Yes|No","list":"p","item_id":23,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPS","correct":"Yes"},{"condition_id":"NPZ_UAMB","text":"Once the dancer began, the ballet achieved incredible success for a show with a new performer.","question":"What show achieved incredible success?","options":"A musical|A ballet","list":"p","item_id":21,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPZ","correct":"A ballet"},{"condition_id":"NPS_AMB","text":"The contestant revealed the money became unavailable to him when the show's budget shrank.","question":"What did the contestant reveal?","options":"The money|The unavailability of the money","list":"p","item_id":22,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPS","correct":"The unavailability of the money"},{"condition_id":"AttachHigh","text":"Gerald introduced himself to the niece of the billionaires who sails vintage yachts around the Vineyard.","question":"What kind of yachts were sailed?","options":"Old ones|Contemporary ones","list":