","list":"j","item_id":11,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPS","correct":"Yes"},{"condition_id":"AttachHigh","text":"At her orientation, Tamara recently met the nephews of the professor who paint beautiful portraits of local celebrities.","question":"Who paints portraits?","options":"The nephews|The professor","list":"j","item_id":70,"block":2,"RNDM":"Attach","correct":"The nephews"},{"condition_id":"MVRR_UAMB","text":"The contestant who was paid the money became unavailable and suddenly terminated his contract.","question":"Did the contestant pay the money to someone?","options":"Yes|No","list":"j","item_id":22,"block":2,"RNDM":"MVRR","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"NPS_AMB","text":"The boy found the chicken stayed surprisingly happy in the new barn.","question":"Was the chicken satisfied in the new barn?","options":"Yes|No","list":"j","item_id":4,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPS","correct":"Yes"},{"condition_id":"AttachLow","text":"Everyone at the coffee shop sympathized with the courier of the florists who were complaining about the weather.","question":"Who complained about the weather?","options":"The courier|The florists","list":"j","item_id":71,"block":2,"RNDM":"Attach","correct":"The florists"},{"condition_id":"NPZ_UAMB","text":"Because the mechanic stopped, the truck needed several more hours before it could be fully repaired.","question":"Did the mechanic stop the truck?","options":"Yes|No","list":"j","item_id":8,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPZ","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"RC_Subj","text":"The class that disliked the teacher skimmed the reading for the week.","question":"Who was disliked?","options":"The class|The teacher","list":"j","item_id":28,"block":2,"RNDM":"RC","correct":"The teacher"},{"condition_id":"RC_Obj","text":"The bus driver who the kids followed wondered about the location of a hotel.","question":"Who was being followed?","options":"The bus driver|The kids","list":"j","item_id":25,"block":2,"RNDM":"RC","correct":"The bus driver"},{"condition_id":"MVRR_UAMB","text":"The