d constant supervision from senior technicians.","question":"Did the engineer maintain the equipment?","options":"Yes|No","list":"j","item_id":15,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPS","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"RC_Obj","text":"The mathematician who the chairman visited created a solution to the wellknown problem.","question":"Who created the solution?","options":"The mathematician|The chairman","list":"j","item_id":38,"block":2,"RNDM":"RC","correct":"The mathematician"},{"condition_id":"NPZ_AMB","text":"After the corrupt politician signed the bill received unwelcome attention from southern voters.","question":"Did the southern voters disapprove of the bill?","options":"Yes|No","list":"j","item_id":2,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPZ","correct":"Yes"},{"condition_id":"AttachLow","text":"On the news they showed the accomplice of the thieves who were indicted for stealing the Mona Lisa.","question":"Where did they show the accomplices?","options":"A documentary|The news","list":"j","item_id":65,"block":2,"RNDM":"Attach","correct":"The news"},{"condition_id":"MVRR_AMB","text":"The little girl fed the lamb remained relatively calm despite having asked for beef.","question":"Did the girl feed the lamb?","options":"Yes|No","list":"j","item_id":16,"block":2,"RNDM":"MVRR","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"AttachMulti","text":"During the budget negotiation, Janet charmed the assistant of the executive who decides almost everything in secret.","question":"What was the venue?","options":"A casual party|A business meeting","list":"j","item_id":54,"block":2,"RNDM":"Attach","correct":"A business meeting"},{"condition_id":"RC_Subj","text":"The children who woke the father bothered him about the trip to the beach.","question":"Who was woken up?","options":"The children|The father","list":"j","item_id":27,"block":2,"RNDM":"RC","correct":"The father"},{"condition_id":"MVRR_UAMB","text":"The new chef who was offered the restaurant separated mediocre cooks from gifted ones.","question":"Did the chef offer the restaurant to someone?","options":"Yes|No","list":"j","item_id":23,"block":2,"RNDM":"MVRR","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"NPZ_AMB","text":"Before the yoga instructor left the position demanded immense physical effort from everyone.","question":"Was the position hard?","options":"Yes|No","list":"j","item_id":17,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPZ","correct":"Yes"},{"condition_id":"RC_Obj","text":"The chef who the cameraman distracted poured the flour onto the counter.","question":"Who was being distracted?","options":"The chef|The cameraman","list":"j","item_id":26,"block":2,"RNDM":"RC","correct":"The chef"},{"condition_id":"AttachLow","text":"At the potluck, Marcus chatted with the aunts of the nun who bakes sugar cookies with cute designs.","question":"What kind of cookies were they?","options":"Oatmeal cookies|Sugar cookies","list":"j","item_id":53,"block":2,"RNDM":"Attach","correct":"Sugar cookies"},{"condition_id":"NPS_UAMB","text":"The dancer knew that the ballet achieved incredible success for a small local production.","question":"What production achieved incredible success?","options":"A ballet|A musical","list":"j","item_id":21,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPS","correct":"A ballet"},{"condition_id":"NPZ_UAMB","text":"Before the patient called, the treatment continued causing uncomfortable side effects like nausea.","question":"Did the patient's nausea last for a while?","options":"Yes|No","list":"j","item_id":19,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPZ","correct":"Yes"},{"condition_id":"NPS_AMB","text":"The apprentice baker discovered the oven produced smaller cakes because it heated too fast.","question":"Did the apprentice baker discover the oven?","options":"Yes|No","list":"j","item_id":24,"block":2,"RNDM":"NPS","correct":"No"},{"condition_id":"AttachHigh","text":"Gerald introduced himself to the niece of the billionaires who sails vintage yachts around the Vineyard.","question":"What kind of yachts were sailed?","options":"Old ones|Contemporary ones","list":"j","item_id":52,"block":2,"RNDM":"